# vehje-runtime-tests, known gaps

## no-std

The crate root carries `#![cfg_attr(not(feature = "std"), no_std)]`
with `default = ["std"]`. The harness exercises driver-side dylib
load paths through std::path types. The no_std variant is reserved
for future cross-target test runners. The lint pack reads only the
literal `#![no_std]` and does not yet recognise the cfg_attr form;
refinement is parked under a future mockspace task. Until then
this gap is documented and accepted.
